{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29a66b7d169ac37486a2a554920fb9103e708bd56833555a96a3661a920f6402", "ja": "（ふう、ようやく資料作成が終わった。\n少し休憩を……ん？　廊下から声がするな）", "zh": "（呼，总算把资料做完了。休息一下吧……嗯？走廊那边好像有声音。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "bea2724b2a4d418b4cef80d4043fa0c38f8d148d7d49fe8e402af0262270577a", "ja": "『うん、それで一緒に……って、ち、違うよ！？\nお仕事の前だったから、たまたま……』", "zh": "『嗯，所以才一起……不对，不、不是啦！？\n只是刚好在工作之前碰上……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e0dea43bed1a01faa6620b6e8921989eb9ac5160ad494febb287f7834aeab6ce", "ja": "（この声は美奈子か？　電話してるみたいだな。\n邪魔になると悪いし、休憩はもう少し後にするか……）", "zh": "（这个声音是美奈子吗？好像在打电话。\n打扰她就不好了，休息还是再晚点吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "c836fdacfc79b304b15b39e002744293de71473177d0799dc12203c91291ea5f", "ja": "はぁ……本当に、わかってくれたのかなぁ？\nもう一度、ちゃんと説明したほうがいいかな。", "zh": "唉……真的明白了吗？\n要不要再好好解释一遍呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e1e23240b3b68fa329586b91709b3896fd428359e22c2b107b0aa177c5abe474", "ja": "電話は……終わったみたいだな。", "zh": "电话……好像已经打完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "8df889dc17c93bb6b832cafa58ab8af1dc54db476886a0c8b5fae4d5759a0414", "ja": "え……あ、{$P$}さん！？\nあっ。ドアの前……す、すみません！", "zh": "诶……啊，{$P$}先生！？\n啊。您在门口……对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "32232a8bffb25b16ba27e95c7df7f5bbe225b9d6a7c8c63995c2af7e7fd085ad", "ja": "電話に夢中で気づかなくて……。えっと……\n話の内容とか、聞こえてない……ですよね？", "zh": "我刚才一直专心打电话，都没注意到……那个……\n刚才聊天的内容，你应该没听见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1e143216690dbac7e46dddeb5845ce99bf6d43c497a62b99607729fc07cc3ebf", "ja": "ああ。もちろん、聞いてないよ。", "zh": "啊，当然没听到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "7a0546e828e528a177c6d5fce0ac7b28eab153dff1a044a164909bae33379e46", "ja": "よかった……。あ、大した話はしてないですよ！\n宿題のこととか、この前フレンチを食べた話とか……。", "zh": "太好了……啊，我们也没聊什么大不了的事啦！\n比如作业的事情，还有前阵子去吃法餐的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d383ace084c9c516cc26a4f7d1d398c77a481bef46dd6ffcf4403bbc8dde5fde", "ja": "フレンチ……。\nもしかして仕事の前に行ったときのことか？", "zh": "法餐……  \n难道是之前工作前去吃的那次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "3bc1931b77037f614298fe171e8d693a652bd6872c42add0802d5559a78efb1d", "ja": "そうです！　お店の中も綺麗ですごかったですし、\nお料理の見た目もおしゃれで、すっごく美味しくて。", "zh": "没错！店里也很漂亮，让人印象深刻，\n菜品的摆盘也很时尚，特别特别好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "5c9c7ec5095f62bb51766da28c1f383b8078071daf03772a8d6272c077b4475e", "ja": "忘れちゃうのがもったいないなって思ってたから、\nつい友達に話しちゃって……。", "zh": "我觉得要是忘了就太可惜了，\n忍不住就跟朋友聊了聊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2d59fb627aebf3f2c75bc374aa1ca0ce0de3fe11d7cda09be2387e3fa9a5863b", "ja": "そうだったのか。そんなに喜んでもらえたなら、\n連れて行った甲斐があるよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。既然你能这么开心，我带你去也算是值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "c7cbef4dbf33564dcc48060c66c1d3c5d5e680532d0b676445c0d4f0460f16b4", "ja": "本当に、素敵な……いい思い出になりました。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "真的成了一段……非常美好的回忆。\n谢谢您，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a2bf0881b547a596e4e84a3b5d8e437ea97d0ec41eb07fe9552a6aee4076d033", "ja": "こちらこそ。……けどそれなら、さっきのは？\n何だか困ってたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。……不过既然这样，刚才那是怎么回事？\n你好像有点困扰的样子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "f6c558cbbd3d63e7d8c5b322c9ff0e460e59b3a1825e7f1a69c9f81048ccf11a", "ja": "そ、それは……{$P$}さんとの関係を\n友達が……ご、誤解……。", "zh": "那、那是……朋友……误会了我和{$P$}先生的关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e56aa798acfc006caf8d520238e62ec640fe15b562e6b2bf7f610ceec8596611", "ja": "美奈子？", "zh": "美奈子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "94441802301d5b2e9f7a966e2a0c14ff5051e9c630ba80aa3b93acfe1f9cf7a0", "ja": "その……あの味を生かしたら、料理のレパートリーが\n増えて困っちゃうねって。あ、あはははは……。", "zh": "那个……要是把那种味道运用起来，料理的花样就会多到让人发愁了呢。啊、啊哈哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0433_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3e61b9e259c19f719d5290011956f817754d7f2a4491f7bea916a79190bf4182", "ja": "（新しい味を早速取り入れようとする美奈子の意欲は、\nさすがだ。俺も少しは見習わないとな！）", "zh": "（美奈子迫不及待想要采用新口味的干劲，真不愧是她。我也得稍微向她学习一下才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
